      "end": 567,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Villa Park\nBefore 1914 , a cycling track ran around the perimeter of the pitch where regular cycling meetings were hosted as well as athletic events . Aside from football-related uses , the stadium has seen various concerts staged along with other sporting events including boxing matches and international rugby league and rugby union matches . In 1999 , the last ever final of the UEFA Cup Winners ' Cup took place at Villa Park . Villa Park also hosted the 2012 FA Community Shield , as Wembley Stadium was in use for the final of the Olympic football tournament ."
